00:26:58.140 --> 00:27:02.160
What advice can you give for pushing through those writing blocks?
因为这些瓶颈有时真的很打击自信心。

590
00:27:02.540 --> 00:27:05.880
Because they can be real self-confidence destroyers sometimes.
还有来自堪萨斯州堪萨斯城的塞拉·G说，

591
00:27:05.880 --> 00:27:07.540
And Sierra G.
你们在写书的时候，有没有经历过自我怀疑？

592
00:27:07.780 --> 00:27:09.180
from Kansas City, Kansas said,
你们是如何克服这种怀疑，并找到勇气和自信的呢？

593
00:27:09.340 --> 00:27:13.520
Did either of you ever struggle with self-doubt while you were working on your book?
去尝试一些新事物，比如写书或做播客？

594
00:27:13.520 --> 00:27:17.420
And how did you overcome that and find the courage and confidence
她还说，提前感谢你们分享见解，

595
00:27:17.420 --> 00:27:21.720
to even try something new, like writing a book or creating a podcast?
以及任何能提升自信的实用技巧。

596
00:27:22.300 --> 00:27:25.280
She also said, Thank you in advance for sharing your insight
塞拉，我必须告诉你，我独自写过很多东西，

597
00:27:25.280 --> 00:27:28.080
and any practical tips for boosting confidence.
但和珍娜一起写作对我来说是一种治愈。

598
00:27:28.540 --> 00:27:31.660
Sierra, I have to tell you, I've written a lot of things by myself,
因为很多时候当你独自写作时，你就像处在一个真空地带。

599
00:27:32.260 --> 00:27:35.680
but writing with Jenna was so healing for me.
因为很多时候当你独自写作时，你就像处在一个真空地带。

600
00:27:36.680 --> 00:27:39.780
Because a lot of times when you write by yourself, you're in this vacuum.
因为很多时候当你独自写作时，你就像处在一个真空地带。

601
00:27:40.500 --> 00:27:43.500
And you can question yourself, like, is this any good?
你会质疑自己，比如，这写得好吗？

602
00:27:44.320 --> 00:27:49.600
But Jenna was like this constant soundboard for me, but solid and honest, you know?
但珍娜一直是我可靠且诚实的倾诉对象，你懂吗？

603
00:27:49.600 --> 00:27:53.920
And one of the things I love about our friendship is that we can be
我喜欢我们友谊的一点就是，我们可以

604
00:27:55.940 --> 00:27:57.140
constructively, compassionately critical.
进行建设性且充满同理心的批评。

605
00:27:57.500 --> 00:28:00.400
I remember so vividly, there was one chapter we were working on.
我记得很清楚，当时我们正在写其中一章。

606
00:28:00.520 --> 00:28:03.900
We worked really hard on it, and then we ended up throwing it out.
我们为此付出了很多努力，但最后还是决定把它删掉。

607
00:28:03.940 --> 00:28:05.380
We're like, It doesn't work.
我们当时想，这行不通。

